c/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Focus on sustainable, long-term search visibility</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Fully aligned with modern Answer Engine and AI search requirements</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="story" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">Why we exist</h2><div class="space-y-6" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:121:5"><p class="text-balance-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:125:13">Search changed twice in five years. First Google started answering questions on its own results page; then ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity and AI Overviews started answering them without a results page at all. Most agencies still sell the 2018 playbook. We rebuilt ours around a simple goal: your brand should be the source an AI quotes, not the page nobody scrolls to.</p><p class="text-balance-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:125:13">AVR Web Consulting was founded to make that level of work affordable. We are a small senior team, not a call centre — the person who audits your site is the person who fixes it and reports on it.</p></div></section><section id="how-we-work" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">How we work</h2><div class="space-y-6" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:121:5"><div data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:132:13"><h3 class="mb-3 text-lg font-semibold" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:133:31">Principles we do not break</h3><ul class="space-y-2" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:134:15"><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Manual, safe, white-hat execution — no automated links, no PBNs, no scraped or AI-dumped content</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Answer-first content structured for both human readers and machine retrieval</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Fixed monthly pricing with no lock-in, so we earn the renewal every month</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">Transparent reporting: rankings, traffic, conversions and AI citations in one document</span></li><li class="flex gap-3" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:136:19"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary" aria-hidden="true" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:137:21"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg><span class="text-foreground/90" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:141:21">You own everything — accounts, content, schema and data stay with you</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id="capabilities" class="scroll-mt-28" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:254:9"><h2 class="mb-5 text-2xl font-bold lg:text-3xl" data-tsd-source="/src/components/site/sections.tsx:255:11">What we do</h